<title>UK: Deutsche Telecom initiated at Goldman.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Telecom initiated at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telecom was rated &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs as the investment bank began coverage of the stock, Goldman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available and analysts at the brokerage could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was up 15 pfennigs at 30.67 marks by 1155 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
